 Values
   (40, 'Special Olympics Torch Run ', TO_DATE('05/26/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), TO_DATE('06/05/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, 
    'GSW  #11', 'The Special Olympics Torch Run will be Thursday, June 4, 2009 from 10:00am until 3:00pm.<BR>
Expect delays on all routes that run with this event - Mall bus delays around 12:30PM <BR>
Route #1: <BR>
E. Colfax Ave. at Yosemite St.: West on E. Colfax Ave. to 1400 Lincoln St.<BR>
Route #2:<BR>
W. Colfax Ave. at Sheridan Blvd.: East on Colfax Ave. to 1400 Lincoln St.<BR>
Route #3:<BR>
1625 So. University Blvd.: North on University Blvd. to 1st Ave., West on 1st Ave. to Speer Blvd., north on Lincoln St. to 1400 Lincoln St.<BR>
At about noon, the runners will be arriving at Veteran?s Park, 1400 Lincoln St. then making their way to the State Capitol Building for a short ceremony. After the brief ceremony the runners will travel north on Lincoln St. to the 16th St. Mall; running as a pack down the mall to Blake St., continuing on Blake St. to Auraria Pkwy. at 7th St.<BR>
Eventually the runners will exit Auraria Pkwy. to north on Market St. to Broadway St., to Brighton Blvd then out of the city.<BR>
Use Caution when the runners are along your route.<BR>
There will be very limited disruption to traffic as runners will be limited to only one lane.   <BR>
The run on the mall seems to draw a large crowd to watch and support the runners.<BR>
Supervisors will assist with Mall disruption', 'May 26, 2009 - June 05, 2009', NULL, NULL);
