   (42, 'Highland Farmers Market - 2009', TO_DATE('06/06/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), TO_DATE('11/01/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, 
    'GSW  #11', 'The Highland Farmers Market will begin on Saturday June 6th through Saturday October 31st this event will occur every Saturday between the hours of 7:00am and 3:00pm. Boulder Street will be closed between 15th Street and 16th Street during the specified hours.<BR>
The following detours are to be observed when barricades are up on Boulder. This event was put on the detour sheet. <BR>
Route-32<BR>
Westbound ? Continue on 15th St. to, right on Umatilla to, right on w. 30th Ave to, left on Tejon and regular route.<BR>
Route-44<BR>
Westbound ? Continue on 15th St. to, right on Umatilla to, right on w. 30th Ave to, left on Tejon and regular route.<BR>
Please accommodate passengers in both directions along the detoured section of this routing.', 'June 06, 2009 - November 01, 2009', NULL, NULL);
