   (19, 'Fallen Firefighters Memorial Parade', TO_DATE('05/09/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), TO_DATE('05/09/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, 
    'GSW #11', 'The parade will begin at Center and Garrison and proceed north on Garrison to, east on Alameda to, south on Allison Parkway to a staging location along Yarrow St. between Virginia and Ohio Avenue.  A memorial service and reception will be held at this location between 9:30AM and 12:30PM. RTD bus traffic will ?not? use Allison Parkway or service Lakewood Commons during this time. <BR>
