   (21, 'Cinco de Mayo Celebration Street Closure', TO_DATE('05/08/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), TO_DATE('05/10/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, 
    'GSW  #11', 'Friday, May 08, through Sunday, May 10, 2009<BR>
From 6pm on Friday until 10pm on Sunday, the following detours are to be observed (with the exception of during the Celebrate Culture Parade). The following Street closures will be Southbound on Broadway at Colfax, Westbound Colfax at Lincoln, Eastbound Colfax at Cherokee, and Bannock at 13th Avenue. Lincoln northbound will be down to 2 lanes from 13th Avenue to Colfax.<BR>
<BR>
Street closures to commence at approximately 6:00pm Friday.<BR>
Detours will be handed out on the day of the events', 'May 08, 2009 - May 10, 2009', NULL, NULL);
