   (29, 'Jazz Festival - Bus Bridge ', TO_DATE('05/16/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), TO_DATE('05/16/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, 
    'GSW  #11', 'On Saturday, May 16th at 10:00am, till 6:30pm, there will be a bus bridge from 25th and Welton to 30th and Downing. The Light Rail Closure will be in effect during the Jazz Festival. Buses will use the following routing while the bus bridge is in effect. <BR>
Southbound: From 30th and Downing to, left on California to, left on 25th St. and load / unload passengers on 25th St. at temporary stop nearside of Welton.<BR>
<BR>
Northbound: Left on Welton to, left on 26th St. to, right on California to, right into Downing Station to terminal.', 'May 16, 2009 - May 16, 2009', NULL, NULL);
