(Staging ? 10:45AM/Parade ? 11:00AM) <BR>
<BR>
This Parade will begin at St. Cajetan?s Church 299 So. Stuart proceed south on Stuart to left on Morrison Rd. to right on Lowell Blvd. south to Sandos Hall (1000 So. Lowell Blvd.) and end. (New location this year)<BR>
 <BR>
This will be a rolling detour, Police will close the road long enough to allow the parade to precede. No bus detours.<BR>
<BR>
Minor delays will be experienced on Routes 3, 11 and 14', 'March 28, 2009 - March 28, 2009', NULL, NULL);
