   (11, 'Colorado School of Mines E-Day Ore Cart Pull ', TO_DATE('04/03/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), TO_DATE('04/03/2009 00:00:00', 'MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, 
    'GSW - S11', 'The Colorado School of Mines, Engineering Department will have an E-Day Ore Cart Pull on Friday, April 03, 2009 @ 9:00am. This procession will begin on Colfax @ Simms, and will continue Eastbound on Colfax to the State Capital where it will disband at approximately 1:00pm. <BR>
<BR>
Only one lane will be used and no detours will be needed. The following routes may experience minor delays:<BR>
<BR>
?<	Routes 1, 7, 10, 16, 16ltd, 30 and 31.', 'April 03, 2009 - April 03, 2009', NULL, NULL);
