    'GSW #11', 'Sunday, April 05, 2009 (3:30PM ? 6:00PM)<BR>
Procession starts out at St. Anthony of Padua Church, 3801 W. Ohio Ave.  Procession proceeds north on So. Newton St. to W. Exposition Ave., then east on W. Exposition Ave. to So. Federal Blvd., then south to W. Ohio Ave., then west to So. Newton St., where the procession returns to the church and ends.  <BR>
